# Build output
#
# Deliberately NOT a bare `build/`. In a sibling repository that pattern hid the
# documentation gate and homepage generator, which the CI workflow runs — present
# locally, green locally, absent in CI, with nothing saying why. Name the output
# directories instead.
dist/
artifacts/
bin/
obj/

# Docusaurus, if a documentation site is added here
.docusaurus/
docs/build/
node_modules/

# The generator's synthetic type-projection scratch directory (schema-gen.ts), always
# created and removed within one `generate()` call — never meant to survive it.
.contract-gen-*/

# Env / secrets
.env
.env.*
*.local

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
